{% comment %}
  "About the company" page (templates/page.companie.json).

  Hero on a showroom photo, key figures, values, the company timeline (2019 -> today,
  facts from the previous page body), showroom, press coverage, collections, customer
  photos and a closing call to action. The reviews slider is a separate section.

  All copy has built-in translations for every storefront language (en.default.json is
  at Shopify's key limit), so the page reads the same on every market. Images, links
  and collections are section settings. Styles: assets/alc-company.css.
{% endcomment %}
